  "goodToKnow": "Das Monopol is a monopoly: ein Monopol haben, das Staatsmonopol. Deutsche Post and Telekom once had state monopolies on post and phones until liberalisation in the 1990s. The Bundeskartellamt in Bonn fights abuse of market power. Das Gewaltmonopol des Staates (the state's monopoly on the use of force), from Max Weber, is a key concept of German political theory. Plural: die Monopole."
